 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun a Rat</strong> 是一款节奏紧凑的非对称多人联机游戏，非常适合与好友一同游玩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扮演 <strong>老鼠</strong> 大肆破坏房屋... 或者扮演 <strong>灭鼠人</strong>，将它们消灭得一只不剩！<br>加入 2 到 20 人的对局，在各式各样的地图中展开对决，每张地图都充满惊喜...</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>独特的语音聊天机制...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>老鼠</strong> 之间可以通过语音交流，完全不用担心被听懂。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因为 <strong>灭鼠人</strong> 听到的只有“吱吱”的叫声，而不是他们的对话！</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>作为老鼠的目标：</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在倒计时结束前，通过破坏和盗取物品达到目标分数，同时要保住小命！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但要小心... 每次破坏发出的声音都会暴露你的位置！</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果 <strong>灭鼠人</strong> 追了过来，<br>快藏进家具里，躲避他的视线！</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>作为灭鼠人：</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用 <strong>摄像头</strong> 监控老鼠的动向，找出它们的藏身之所...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >精心布置 <strong>陷阱</strong>，尽可能拖慢它们的节奏</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将它们 <strong>赶尽杀绝</strong>！</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丰富多样的陷阱供你选择，<br>每种陷阱都能给 <strong>老鼠</strong> 带来“意想不到”的惊喜...</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不断进行对局来赚取 <strong>奶酪币</strong>，<br>用它们兑换各种皮肤，打造属于你的个性老鼠！</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>那么，你选择站在哪一边？</strong></p></p>",
